</head><body><div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 22 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Division進階</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">兩位數 ÷ 一位數 · 有餘數 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 餘數必須小於除數！「餘數&lt;除數」係鐵律！<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L08 基本Division · Multiplication表<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 兩位數÷一位數直式 ❷ 餘數處理 ❸ 驗證方法 ❹ Divisible判斷<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3下A冊 單元二
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>24 ÷ 6 = ？（用乘數表逆向：6x?=24）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>35 ÷ 5 = ？（5x?=35）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>17 ÷ 3 = ？商 = ＿＿，餘 = ＿＿（餘數 &lt; 3？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>45 ÷ 6 = ？（先估商：6x7=42，45-42=3）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>以下邊個啱？A. 26÷4=5...6 B. 26÷4=6...2 C. 26÷4=7...-2</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：兩位數 ÷ 一位數 直式<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>步驟：</strong>十位除 → 有剩就拉落個位 → 再除<br/>
② <strong>72 ÷ 3：</strong>十位7÷3=2...1 → 剩1+個位2=12 → 12÷3=4 → 答案<strong>24</strong><br/>
③ <strong>驗證：</strong>除數 x 商 + 餘數 = 被除數<br/>
④ <strong>Mnemonic：</strong>「先除十位，有剩加落個位，再除埋佢！」
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：Divisible（冇餘數）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">🍬 96 粒糖，平均分給 4 個小朋友。每人有幾粒？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">直式：96 ÷ 4<br/>十位：9÷4=<strong>2</strong>...1（2x4=8，9-8=1）<br/>剩1+個位6=16，16÷4=<strong>4</strong><br/>答案：<strong>24 粒</strong>（驗證：4x24=96 ✓）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：有餘數！（Trap重點）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">85 ÷ 6 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 小Trap怪獸話</div><div class="eq">85÷6 = 13...7</div><div class="why">7 &gt; 6！餘數大過除數！仲可以除多次！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">85÷6 = 14...1</div><div class="why">十位8÷6=1...2；25÷6=4...1；餘數1&lt;6 ✓。驗證：6x14+1=84+1=85 ✓</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：「餘數 &lt; 除數」係鐵律！永遠檢查：餘數係咪細過除數？如果唔係 → 商可以再加1！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 檢查三步曲：① 除數 x 商 = ？② 加返餘數 = ？③ 餘數 &lt; 除數？</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>84 ÷ 4 = ？（直式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>91 ÷ 7 = ？（用乘數表逆向：7x?=91）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>67 ÷ 5 = ？（有餘數，檢查餘數 &lt; 5）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>98 ÷ 8 = ？（直式 + 驗證）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：估商策略<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>估商 = 搵最接近但不超過嘅乘積</strong><br/>
② 例：73 ÷ 8 → 8x9=72（最接近73）→ 商=9，餘=1<br/>
③ <strong>上調：</strong>如果乘積太小 → 商+1<br/>
④ <strong>下調：</strong>如果乘積太大（超過被除數）→ 商-1<br/>
⑤ <strong>祕技：</strong>用Multiplication表逆向諗：「8x?=最接近73但又唔超過73？」
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3：估商練習</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">57 ÷ 7 = ？試估商！</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">7x8=56（最接近57）→ 商=<strong>8</strong>，餘=57-56=<strong>1</strong><br/>驗證：7x8+1=56+1=57 ✓，1&lt;7 ✓</div></div>
<div class="lf-game">
<div style="font-size:24px;">🎮 估商大作戰！</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">「估商高手」挑戰：睇到Division即刻估商！<br/>例如見到 59÷7 →即刻諗：7x8=56 → 商8！</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>估商練習：46÷5（5x?最接近46？），53÷6（6x?最接近53？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>38 ÷ 4 = ？（估商 + 驗證）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>82 ÷ 9 = ？（估商：9x?最接近82？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Divisible判斷<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>Divisible = 冇餘數</strong>（餘數 = 0）<br/>
② 點知一個數能否被Divisible？用乘數表檢查！<br/>
③ 例：72 可以被 8 Divisible嗎？8x9=72 → 可以！<br/>
④ 例：73 可以被 8 Divisible嗎？8x9=72, 8x10=80 → 唔可以！餘1<br/>
⑤ 能被 2 Divisible = 雙數；能被 5 Divisible = 個位係 0 或 5；能被 10 Divisible = 個位係 0
</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>63 ÷ 3 = ？（直式，Divisible）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>48 ÷ 4 = ？（直式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>55 ÷ 5 = ？（Divisible，用乘數表驗證）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
