<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>95 ÷ 4 = ？（商有兩位數）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一個數除以 6，商是 15，餘數是 4。這個數是多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>除數是 7，餘數最大可以是幾多？除數是 9 呢？找出規律！</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
